// Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2021-12-18
// Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1046, attack.t1135
// Description: Detects the use of Advanced Port Scanner.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "/portable") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "/lng"))) OR ((where(Image ICONTAINS "\\advanced_port_scanner")) OR (where(OriginalFileName ICONTAINS "advanced_port_scanner")) OR (where(Description ICONTAINS "Advanced Port Scanner"))))
